            aOrbiterJ = (((aWandererJ + RotL64(aIngress, 19U)) + RotL64(aCarry, 53U)) + 0x934F6A8D28AE82AEULL) + aKeySpawnOrbiterAssignSaltF[(((31U - aIndex) + 11U)) & S_SALT1];
